# **How to Read This Graph**
- **Vertical flow = dependency chain**  
  Tier 0 → Tier 1 → Tier 2 → Tier 3 → Tier 4  
- **Horizontal clusters = parallel unlocks**  
- **Arrows = substrate dependencies**  
- **Spacing = conceptual distance**  
- **Box width = conceptual weight**  

This ASCII version is intentionally clean and symmetrical so you can translate it into a PNG later without losing structure.

---

──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 TRIADIC SUBSTRATE COLOR LEGEND
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

   ■  BLUE  —  STRUCTURE  (S)
        • Form, architecture, identity
        • Stable configurations
        • Domain boundaries
        • Structural invariants

   ■  RED / ORANGE  —  ACTIVATION  (E)
        • Energy, affect, arousal, motivation
        • Signal strength and flow
        • Instability, volatility, transitions
        • Activation spikes and cascades

   ■  GREEN  —  RELATIONAL TIME  (R)
        • Development, memory, temporal context
        • Regime transitions
        • Long‑arc trajectories
        • Identity evolution

──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 TIER COLOR CODING
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

   ■  GRAY (light)     — Tier 0: Pre‑Existing Tools
   ■  BLUE‑GREEN       — Tier 1: Substrate Unlocks
   ■  GOLD             — Tier 2: Domain Unlocks
   ■  PURPLE           — Tier 3: Cross‑Domain Unlocks
   ■  WHITE / SILVER   — Tier 4: Civilization Unlocks

──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 ARROW / EDGE LEGEND
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

   →  Solid Arrow
        Substrate dependency (required unlock)

   ⇢  Curved Arrow
        Cross‑domain influence or coupling

   ⇣  Dashed Arrow
        Emergent unlock (appears only when multiple
        prerequisites are satisfied)

──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 NODE HALOS
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

   ◉  Haloed Node
        Indicates a substrate‑critical unlock
        (all Tier 1 nodes should have halos)

──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
